{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S02\",\"screen\":\"像熟人安静坐着 偶尔对视也不尴尬\",\"source\":\"像相识已久的人安静坐着，不必拼命找话题；对方偶尔望来一眼，沉默也不让人紧张。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿写的是对方偶尔单方面望来一眼，屏幕稿改成双方对视，增加了相互注视这一动作。\"},{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"screen\":\"这份亲近像年少时第一次心动的下午\",\"source\":\"那份纯净像清凉、空灵的月光，又让人忽然想起童年，或年少时第一次心动的下午。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿是新旋律的纯净让人想起初次心动的下午，屏幕稿则把这个比喻转移到两人的亲近上，改变了比喻所指。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "59f4c857-30cc-4f3d-a8fa-54d675ed50ea", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T201709716944Z", "elapsed_seconds": 469.328, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T20:24:59.134227+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6b58d2cb0b18d936a2076831ad5efce0e7003938b8f4604375ed47bdbadd8e0f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "e